# Force HTTPS and apex domain redirects
http://kushalgangarapu.com/*     https://kushalgangarapu.com/:splat     301!
http://www.kushalgangarapu.com/* https://kushalgangarapu.com/:splat     301!
https://www.kushalgangarapu.com/* https://kushalgangarapu.com/:splat    301!

# Netlify-style _redirects — intentionally NO catch-all.
# Every in-app route is hash-based (#/file/…, #/recruiter), so there are no
# client-side paths to rewrite. A `/* /index.html 200` fallback would answer
# 200 for every typo'd URL — soft-404s that poison crawling. Real files and
# /hire/ serve directly; everything else correctly hits /404.html.
